{"asset_key":"mn/gameplay_story_10645010","episode":"mn","category":"gameplay_story","story_id":"10645010","schema_version":1,"lang":"cn","texts":{"say:1:1064501001:0":{"text":"波恩大剧院舞台中央，昔日宏大的交响乐团早已解散，唯有乐团首席——巴托克，正独奏着古典乐章。","source_cn":"波恩大剧院舞台中央，昔日宏大的交响乐团早已解散，唯有乐...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA2AD2304A1C40D89","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1064501002:1":{"text":"演奏已过大半，他缓缓起身，向台下寥寥几位听众鞠躬示意。","source_cn":"演奏已过大半，他缓缓起身，向台下寥寥几位听众鞠躬示意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEDB91C366269E41E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1064501003:0":{"text":"感谢各位，在这样动荡的时刻，仍愿意来到这里。","source_cn":"感谢各位，在这样动荡的时刻，仍愿意来到这里。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x63F527EC2166609A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1064501004:0":{"text":"接下来这套组曲，是我多年来一直追寻的旋律——它出自传说中的执掌音律的半神，<style=\"highlight\">奥菲戈斯</style>。","source_cn":"接下来这套组曲，是我多年来一直追寻的旋律——它出自传说...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x25D324C3CD71FF80","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1064501005:0":{"text":"我穷尽半生研习，也只能触及其中些许高雅与庄严。","source_cn":"我穷尽半生研习，也只能触及其中些许高雅与庄严。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB5E4B72AFD96EE0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1064501006:0":{"text":"那份令灵魂重归和谐的神韵，或许只存在于半神的演奏中，凡人无法触及。","source_cn":"那份令灵魂重归和谐的神韵，或许只存在于半神的演奏中，凡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF0F3E9378D7600DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1064501007:0":{"text":"即便如此，每当这旋律响起，我都能感到内心变得无比安宁。愿各位，能在这段乐声中，暂时忘却城内的阴霾。","source_cn":"即便如此，每当这旋律响起，我都能感到内心变得无比安宁。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEC32A5FD67E929D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1064501008:0":{"text":"巴托克重新落座，第一串音符流淌而出，带有一种不可动摇的秩序感——像一道从容的光芒飞越了混乱的大地。  ","source_cn":"巴托克重新落座，第一串音符流淌而出，带有一种不可动摇的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF66831197064F3C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1064501009:0":{"text":"台下寥寥几名听众慢慢放松了肩膀，连呼吸都变得轻缓。","source_cn":"台下寥寥几名听众慢慢放松了肩膀，连呼吸都变得轻缓。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB090E5CE047DDF81","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1064501010:1":{"text":"这时，剧院大门被猛然推开！","source_cn":"这时，剧院大门被猛然推开！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F0B3DFE039AD7C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1064501011:1":{"text":"巴托克先生，晚上好。\n加入<style=\"highlight\">黑金乐团</style>的事，您考虑得怎样了？","source_cn":"巴托克先生，晚上好。\\n加入<style=highli...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC8948FC45A9CE2C5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1064501012:0":{"text":"又是你们……","source_cn":"又是你们……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF65929368526A6A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1064501013:0":{"text":"利拉向身旁的几名同伙使了个眼色，后者快步走向听众席。","source_cn":"利拉向身旁的几名同伙使了个眼色，后者快步走向听众席。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xACBC0C8EFD09EF48","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1064501014:0":{"text":"演出到此为止！赶紧滚！","source_cn":"演出到此为止！赶紧滚！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFD20E93ACB02C09C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1064501015:0":{"text":"嘿嘿，要是你们实在想听演奏，就去我们黑金乐团！","source_cn":"嘿嘿，要是你们实在想听演奏，就去我们黑金乐团！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20F7DF32C9E85598","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1064501016:0":{"text":"听众们惊惶起身，转眼间，剧院只剩下巴托克与这群不速之客。","source_c